WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { background-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.92); color:#28241E; font-family:"Lexend","Atkinson Hyperlegible",sans-serif; line-height:1.4; font-size:140%; font-weight:600; }

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.500
This is the Reader.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.584
Paste your text here, open a file, like a PDF,

00:00:05.614 --> 00:00:09.510
a Word document, or a book, or open one from your Library.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.311
Then open Reading settings, and shape it to suit you,

00:00:14.341 --> 00:00:16.600
the font, the size, and the spacing.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.840
And you can turn on a reading ruler, with three options to suit you.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.076
A soft band that follows your pointer and marks your line,

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:28.124
or it highlights word by word as it reads aloud,

00:00:28.154 --> 00:00:30.670
or it focuses your line and dims the rest.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.166
And there is a voice and speed option,

00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:37.150
so Nibras reads aloud just the way you like.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.310
Set it once, and Nibras remembers, every time you come back.
